## Edge Cases and Error Handling
| Situation | Expected behaviour |
|-----------|-------------------|
| TI download blocked/unavailable | Stop and report; do not substitute memory for citations without flagging it |
| Audit finding vs. test expectation disagree | Audit report wins; test becomes xfail citing the report |
| Plans conflict on shared files | Later plan rebases on earlier plan's changes (order above is dependency order) |

